3023/Q2302301","priority":5,"questId":23023,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":230230101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4080,"speakerName":"Gurgen","textMapHash":2801900698,"text":"We can't go on like this, Father. The roses are not growing well.","nextNodeIds":[230230102]},{"nodeId":230230102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":1322959786,"text":"We must work out something quick, or we won't be able to deliver all the herbs on time this year!","nextNodeIds":[230230103]},{"nodeId":230230103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4080,"speakerName":"Gurgen","textMapHash":1223087354,"text":"The soil is good. We've disposed of the weeds and pests. So what's going on here?","nextNodeIds":[230230104]},{"nodeId":230230104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2744507226,"text":"What's bothering you?","nextNodeIds":[230230105]},{"nodeId":230230105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":377117666,"text":"Oh? Are you here to buy herbs?","nextNodeIds":[230230106]},{"nodeId":230230106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":385522810,"text":"Well, we send batches of herbs to Bimarstan at regular intervals.","nextNodeIds":[230230107]},{"nodeId":230230107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":1554798546,"text":"The most important herb of all is the special \"Sumeru Rose.\"","nextNodeIds":[230230108]},{"nodeId":230230108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":817450690,"text":"Roses can be used as medicine?","nextNodeIds":[230230109]},{"nodeId":230230109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":2697425490,"text":"That's a question you need to direct toward the doctors at Bimarstan.","nextNodeIds":[230230110]},{"nodeId":230230110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":4032706370,"text":"They say the rose can be used in tandem with other medicines to cure heatstroke and soothe stomachaches, and that it even has some other benefits... none of which I recall at the moment.","nextNodeIds":[230230111,230230113]},{"nodeId":230230111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2424577642,"text":"In that case, I'll help out.","nextNodeIds":[230230112]},{"nodeId":230230112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":1406564090,"text":"We would be most grateful!","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":230230113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3308725970,"text":"What's wrong with this rose?","nextNodeIds":[230230114]},{"nodeId":230230114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":1125135442,"text":"For some reason, it is growing incredibly slowly.","nextNodeIds":[230230115]},{"nodeId":230230115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":2890707714,"text":"Our experience tells us that this is usually either a soil or a pest problem.","nextNodeIds":[230230116]},{"nodeId":230230116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":3946370650,"text":"But we have planted other herbs here using the same soil, and those have grown up just fine.","nextNodeIds":[230230117]},{"nodeId":230230117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4080,"speakerName":"Gurgen","textMapHash":3374808538,"text":"We also perform pest control every day. So it can't be the pests...","nextNodeIds":[230230118]},{"nodeId":230230118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4080,"speakerName":"Gurgen","textMapHash":1309853738,"text":"This is no time to get obsessed with the possibilities. Any more stalling, and we won't be able to deliver the roses to Bimarstan on time.","nextNodeIds":[230230119]},{"nodeId":230230119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":127974226,"text":"Our current plan is to fertilize the soil with a special fertilizer.","nextNodeIds":[230230120]},{"nodeId":230230120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":2195670114,"text":"But we need to take care of other fields at the same time. As such, we haven't any time left to collect materials for the fertilizer.","nextNodeIds":[230230121]},{"nodeId":230230121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":222462722,"text":"Traveler, for the sake of the patients at Bimarstan, would you please do us this favor?","nextNodeIds":[230230122]},{"nodeId":230230122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3940850554,"text":"I will.","nextNodeIds":[230230123]},{"nodeId":230230123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":3911886434,"text":"We would be most grateful!","nextNodeIds":[230230124]},{"nodeId":230230124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":4079,"speakerName":"Vardan","textMapHash":223602370,"text":"Let's see. Our current situation is...","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[2302301,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_TARGET","LNHLPKELCAL":["4079"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}},{"subQuestId":2302302,"order":2,"stepDescription":"Hand 3 Harra Fruits to Vardan","stepDescTextMapHash":660576540,"finishConds":[{"BFGALAINLMD"